# Build context for the Dockerfile next to this file (used instead of the repo's own
# .dockerignore): only the package manifests and colcon ignore markers. Source edits then
# never invalidate the dependency layer, and the context stays small.
*
!src/**/package.xml
!src/**/COLCON_IGNORE
!src/**/AMENT_IGNORE
!src/**/CATKIN_IGNORE
